<title>USA: Molecular Biosystems says FDA accepts filing.</title>
<headline>Molecular Biosystems says FDA accepts filing.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Molecular Biosystems Inc on Monday said the U.S. Food and Drug Administration has accepted its pre-marketing approval application for its contrasting agent, FS069, that is used in ultrasound procedures.</p>
<p>The FDA will now conduct a review of FS069. The company expects to file for approval in Europe early next year, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
